  "question": {
    "text": "<p>The value of current&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math> flowing from <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math> to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math> in the circuit diagram is :</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/cba9f4a1-9952-463d-b268-081576e134bb-image.png\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 224px;\" />&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>",
